WEBVTT

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.780
What is it? What is it?

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.090
Wait a minute!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.890
In 1803, a strange
boat-like object...

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.300
...drifted ashore
in the country of Mutsu.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.460
On the boat was a foreign
woman sitting all alone.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.870
The fishermen pushed the boat
out to the sea...

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.910
...without knowing where she
came from or who she was.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.850
According to a village elder, she must
have been given a punishment...

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.690
...to let heaven decide her fate
due to the crime she committed.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:43.800
All right! All right! Okay!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.630
Thank you very much!

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.590
- Mayumi-chan.
- What?

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.270
The boss said
you could wrap up for today.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:56.970
- Here's your pay.
- Thank you very much!

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:02.780
- Have you considered working full-time?
- Yes, but I can't work all day.

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:05.420
Is it because of your boyfriend?

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.920
Yes. I need to take care of him.

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:14.150
- You don't have to say no flat out.
- I'm sorry.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:19.460
It's hard to find a part-time employee
like you. Keep up the great work.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:23.100
Yes. Thank you.
I hope I'll keep you happy!

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:26.070
PARK

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.840
It's almost winter.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:43.150
- Hi, I'm home!
- Welcome home.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:48.300
I'm making a feast today.
It's radish and stuffed cabbage.

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:50.900
It's been a long time.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:54.330
- She told me you two were friends.
- Oh, yes.

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:59.770
- Then please take your time.
- Yes. Thank you.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.320
I thought you would come someday.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.820
Do you know me?

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:16.150
Yes, because I'm...

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.160
...Shinma too.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:59.860
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:04.300
...and lead them to ruin.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:10.310
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:14.710
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.850
...in the human world.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:21.710
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:28.360
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:34.060
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:38.170
No one knows her true face.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:10.100
Yaguchi told me
he wanted to become a novelist...

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.970
...for a long time.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:18.200
But he gave up because
he decided to get married.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:23.150
When they got married, his wife
was already carrying their baby.

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:27.980
So he gave up his dream to work
hard for the sake of the baby too.

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:38.230
- What can you see?
- The ocean beyond.

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:43.960
You seem to have lots of time.
Human adults don't have that luxury.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.730
You're right.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:50.500
Everyone just works hard
and ignores everything else.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:54.550
I was the same way.
But one day I realized that...

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:59.590
...I wouldn't have anything left even
if I worked hard. So now I'm here.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.560
Isn't that selfish of you?

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.020
Maybe so.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:08.360
But I don't have a wife or daughter
anymore. I'm all alone.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.020
You left your child.

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:15.640
The bond between father and child
cannot be cut off so easily.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.830
No. It was me who was cut off.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.310
I can't believe that.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:24.500
That's how it is.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:28.540
He didn't know why
his daughter disliked him.

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:32.190
She left home, though
she was still in high school.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.920
After that, he didn't get
along with his wife.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:39.820
So he left all their savings
to his wife and left home.

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:42.520
He then met me.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.700
That's why he is penniless.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:50.870
He says he would work. But then
he wouldn't have time to write.

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:53.040
So I work instead.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:56.240
You don't say anything about yourself.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.510
Me? I have nothing
to say about myself.

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:02.450
I'm fully aware I'm Shinma.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.920
You know what that's like, don't you?

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:07.150
Yes.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:12.420
But as long as I'm with Yaguchi,
I can forget about myself!

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:17.570
I can be of service to someone!
Yaguchi is my dream!

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:21.760
When human and Shinma live
together, destruction comes.

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.260
Not just to you, but also to him.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.870
Are you okay with that?

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:31.040
Of course I'm not okay with that.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.410
Then you know what you should do.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.740
Please, let me be with him
a little longer!

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:42.020
When I'm not needed,
I'll come to you to be sealed off.

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:46.330
It's just a little time
for the Guardian, right?

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:51.890
It is for me to decide
if you are to be sealed off.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:55.870
- I'll come again.
- Can't we?

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:59.510
Can't we be happy together?

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:02.970
No. Not for eternity.

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:10.910
Good doggy.

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:14.560
- Oh, you're leaving so soon?
- Yes.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.990
Please come again.
I'm sure she is lonely.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:22.690
- Yes, I'll come again.
- Until then.

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:28.230
You're playful, but I have
nothing else for you.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:33.470
- Have you dealt with it?
- I thought I wouldn't see you again.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.670
You thought wrong.

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:39.280
We became enemies, didn't we, Miyu?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:42.810
So we can freely target stray Shinma.

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:46.020
Shinma will perish
even if you do nothing.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:50.020
Then it's okay for me to finish her.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:55.250
If you touch them, I'll make sure
you won't stay in this world.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.130
I will not touch the human.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.670
- It's hard to believe you.
- I have my reasons.

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.270
Wait a minute!
What do you mean, Reiha?

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:08.440
Don't you understand, Matsukaze?

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:12.270
- Are you having a falling-out?
- None of your business!

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:16.010
You're right.
I want to keep it that way too.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:21.950
I'll leave for now.
But I will keep an eye on them.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.890
And on you too, Miyu.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.580
Oh, did I wake you up?

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:51.910
I was having a dream.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:55.990
Must be about your daughter.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:01.160
- Then about your wife?
- No. About our future.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.070
- Can I tell you about it?
- Yes!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:07.830
We are living in a quiet house...

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.160
...pursuing the good life.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:14.600
That's right, we'll take our time,
not bothered by anyone...

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:18.370
...thinking how we can lead
a good life. You and me.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.110
- Am I there?
- Sure.

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:25.210
You make me tea, clean rooms...

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:28.180
...and you listen to me.

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.650
You also do whatever you like.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:33.950
- All day?
- Yes, forever.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:36.390
It's wonderful.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:40.160
It's just a dream.
Life is not that easy.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.130
No! It'll come true!
Make it come true!

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:47.170
I just want to escape from reality.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:51.750
I might keep running away all
my life, but it's not allowed.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:55.380
That's not true! Run and run
and finally get away...

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:57.850
...from a world like this!

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:02.880
- Mayumi.
- What?

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:08.690
Aren't you lonesome? Someone your age
would have more fun things to do.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:10.990
Like having fun with friends.

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:16.270
It's nothing for you to worry about,
Yaguchi. This was my choice.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:19.460
I see. Thank you.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:24.140
I didn't have any true friends.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:28.540
So just being with you
makes me happy.

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:31.740
That girl today was just like you.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:35.950
- She could be because we are the same.
- She looked sad.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:41.320
I'm not because I have you, Yaguchi.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.690
- Let's go to bed.
- Yes.

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:51.130
- Well...
- Yes?

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:55.870
What is your daughter like?
Is she like me?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.640
No, she is more...

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:01.650
She was already a grown woman at 16.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:05.620
- I know I'm not sexy.
- It's not that. You're cute.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.290
You can't approach
women using "cute."

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:10.860
I don't intend to.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:15.160
If you can't get women,
you can't write a novel either.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.560
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:22.000
Maybe I can't.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:26.770
That's not true!
You are someone I chose!

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:29.470
You're doing your best every day!

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:32.810
You're right.
I need to finish my novel.

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:38.520
- Can I read it first when you finish?
- Of course.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:41.750
- I can't wait.
- Yeah.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:47.890
All right! All right!
Thank you very much!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.930
Mayumi-chan, car wash next, please.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.360
Okay.

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.850
I'll never divorce you.

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:20.590
Why? You have no feelings
left for me, do you?

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:25.520
That's right! But I won't let you
leave at your convenience!

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:28.760
I wasted my whole life for you!

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:32.240
You will pay
for the rest of your life!

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.110
How is Satomi?

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:40.770
Not much going on. She is
still living in an apartment.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:43.470
- Are you concerned?
- No.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:47.620
I'm home!
It was pretty chilly today...

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.890
Welcome home.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:56.760
- It's you! You swindled him!
- I...

00:12:56.970 --> 00:13:02.230
He loved his family!
He never gambled or played around!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:04.800
He worked hard for our family!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:08.240
Now he's quit his job
and lives in filth with you!

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:11.870
You destroyed our home!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.710
We already discussed it.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.820
You keep quiet!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.220
A young girl like you
can find anyone she wants.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.950
Please give him back to me!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.560
- I feel sorry...
- What do you mean?

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:29.820
Yaguchi is not yours!
He can make up his own mind!

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:34.560
- Don't talk like you know better!
- Stop. Please stop!

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:38.000
- Stop it! Don't, Norie! Stop!
- I can't breathe.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.200
Stop!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.090
Oh, don't tell me...

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.360
Yaguchi, you'd better not be here!

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:14.300
I'll just say you were out!
Okay? Hurry up!

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:17.840
Let's run away.
Let's run away together.

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:21.500
If we do that,
you will never become a novelist!

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.950
It's our dream!

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:28.680
You are always in my dream.
If I have you, I'm happy.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:32.920
No! It's absolutely not acceptable!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.490
I want you to come with me.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.920
I wonder how long it's been
since I ate an ekiben. Let's eat.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.380
Okay.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:08.290
Not much has changed
since I first came out to Tokyo.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.660
- To go to college?
- Right.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:14.460
I was 18 and thought
I could do anything.

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:17.000
Right. That's right.

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:23.010
I'm sorry, Yaguchi.
I destroyed your dream.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:27.210
Sorry. Please don't cry.
I didn't mean it that way.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:30.410
I know, but...

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:35.420
I destroyed it myself.
It's always the case.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:41.120
Mayumi, we are going on a trip.
Just the two of us.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:45.460
- We'll be together forever.
- Okay.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:51.600
- Now let's eat while it's still warm.
- Yes, let's eat.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:56.770
- She finally did it.
- I hope you are prepared.

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:57.970
I know.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:01.240
The blame will be laid
on the human, right?

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:05.150
- For what sin?
- The sin in the human world.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:09.350
A human being died.
Is there any other sin?

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:10.620
No, there isn't.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:15.320
That's why we should have sent
that Shinma back to the darkness!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:19.300
Strange, you are
concerned about humans.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.770
I think so too.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:33.140
My old acquaintance lives
in this neighborhood.

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:36.550
- We're almost there.
- Okay.

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:42.980
Miyu!

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:48.530
I wonder if Miyu will
take pity on them?

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.360
I hope that's the case!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:54.560
Then we'll have one more prey
or even maybe two.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:57.500
That human will probably resist too.

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:00.770
- I can't get in the mood.
- How come?

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:05.010
That Shinma might be
a daughter to that human.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:09.380
What are you talking about?
You've been acting weird lately!

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:13.180
Aren't you happy?
I just don't understand!

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:17.120
If you don't understand, just shut up!

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:26.290
I need to send you off
because it's my duty.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:29.640
I know. We can't help it, I guess.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:32.830
I don't understand this,
but please let us go!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:37.570
I'll take the blame!
She hasn't done anything!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.270
It's okay, Yaguchi.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.750
This has been decided
ever since I was born.

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:46.280
You mean we can't change our fate?

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:51.820
That's right. But not in your case.
Please become a good novelist.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:55.160
No! I don't want to do it by myself!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:58.490
It is our dream, yours and mine!

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:05.200
Miyu, I'm going to fight.
I might just be able to win!

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:08.310
- Should we go somewhere else?
- No.

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:12.910
I want Yaguchi to see
what I really am.

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:23.890
AYU

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.620
This is me.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:30.460
Now do you understand
why I can't stay with you?

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:32.900
- I've known.
- What?

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:37.090
To me there were times
when you looked human...

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:41.070
...and other times when
you looked like now.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:47.950
That's why I didn't think you...

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:55.680
...or her to be strange.

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:59.420
I felt that your kind could
exist in this world.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:01.390
Then why did you stay?

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:07.130
You understood me.
And I thought I understood you.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:14.900
Thank you, Yaguchi.
I'm already happy enough.

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:17.740
Miyu, here I come!

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:30.090
- Larva, don't interfere!
- All right, Miyu.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:42.160
Stray Shinma, into the darkness.

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:47.430
Mayumi!

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:55.310
Goodbye, Yaguchi.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:00.190
Mayumi!

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:09.450
- Why did you destroy Mayumi?
- Because it was her destiny.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.620
Why is there such a thing as destiny?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:17.130
We only wished for a little happiness.

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:18.830
I know.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:22.170
Send me away too!
I want to go with Mayumi!

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:25.000
I can't.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:31.150
At least I can give you
eternal happiness.

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:55.440
Did you do this with your power?

00:20:56.680 --> 00:21:01.510
Is that so? You can't be happy
if you remain grown-up?

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.710
Is it to erase the sin?

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:08.790
Right. All the sins.
He deserves it.

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:17.190
Here is a Moray boat.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.080
Where will it go?

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:44.160
- Westward.
- West?

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:49.630
I have heard of a land of happiness
there, with no worries or suffering.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:52.930
Not very many people get to go there.

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:57.370
We can't go there, can we?

00:21:57.570 --> 00:22:00.510
No, forever.

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:18.950
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:21.490
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:25.630
...from so far away?

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:28.460
Someone smooths down my hair

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:32.730
Who are you?

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:39.400
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:39.610 --> 00:22:44.240
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:48.720
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:53.190
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:57.390
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.860
Washed away

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:08.670
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:13.110
Invited by the moon

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:17.050
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:26.220
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:33.390
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.580 --> 00:23:46.610
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:46.810 --> 00:23:49.150
