00:24:47.340 --> 00:24:53.870
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:54.120 --> 00:25:01.040
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.190 --> 00:25:10.130
The city is falling apart
as if it were sand.

00:25:10.330 --> 00:25:13.790
Still, people go to work...

00:25:14.000 --> 00:25:17.660
...as if it is the normal way to live.

00:25:17.870 --> 00:25:21.540
Who knew that another city...

00:25:21.740 --> 00:25:24.270
...was being born?

00:25:24.480 --> 00:25:29.250
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu:
"City of Illusion."

00:25:29.450 --> 00:25:33.110
The city is indestructible.
